{"unit_id":"life1996cou__dsh-timer#card-zh","repo":"life1996cou/dsh-timer","commit":"2c9cbf0397c7fd0a9bfd282c80361f28d3bc4d92","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@deepseek-ai/dsh-timer 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的计划任务插件。它在消息输入框下方的工具栏加入开关和任务列表，并通过宿主服务登记计划；开启开关后点击发送按钮可为当前草稿选择稍后执行时间。主要功能包括创建定时任务、一键选择错峰时间、查看待执行或运行中等状态、取消单项任务和清空列表。到达时间后，插件会在创建任务的原始会话中继续提交内容，并依据会话状态显示完成或失败。适合需要把提示安排到稍后在原会话执行的 DSH Web 用户；需要 DSH Web 正在运行且保留该会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:250-318","lib/client.js:319-337","lib/index.js:4157-4180","lib/index.js:4194-4245"]}
{"unit_id":"life1996cou__dsh-timer#card-en","repo":"life1996cou/dsh-timer","commit":"2c9cbf0397c7fd0a9bfd282c80361f28d3bc4d92","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@deepseek-ai/dsh-timer schedules prompts in DSH Web. Its composer switch opens a time picker when Send is clicked. Users can select an off-peak time, track status, cancel tasks, or clear the list. The host continues each prompt in its original session, which must remain available.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:250-318","lib/client.js:319-337","lib/index.js:4157-4180","lib/index.js:4194-4245"]}
