{"unit_id":"life1996cou__dsh-timer#feature-1","repo":"life1996cou/dsh-timer","commit":"2c9cbf0397c7fd0a9bfd282c80361f28d3bc4d92","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@deepseek-ai/dsh-timer 的功能「定时安排提示」：开启工具栏开关后点击发送按钮，在确认框选择未来时间并确认；插件把草稿内容和当前会话提交给宿主，到时在原会话继续执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:288-318","lib/client.js:319-337","lib/index.js:4194-4227"]}
{"unit_id":"life1996cou__dsh-timer#feature-2","repo":"life1996cou/dsh-timer","commit":"2c9cbf0397c7fd0a9bfd282c80361f28d3bc4d92","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@deepseek-ai/dsh-timer 的功能「错峰选时」：在计划确认框点击“错高峰”，自动把时间设为邻近的空闲时段；再次点击可恢复之前保存的选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:34-40","lib/client.js:366-380"]}
{"unit_id":"life1996cou__dsh-timer#feature-3","repo":"life1996cou/dsh-timer","commit":"2c9cbf0397c7fd0a9bfd282c80361f28d3bc4d92","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@deepseek-ai/dsh-timer 的功能「任务状态列表」：打开任务面板查看各任务的计划时间、提示摘要及待执行、运行中、完成或失败状态；面板打开时每五秒刷新。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:188-205","lib/client.js:280-287","lib/client.js:416-468"]}
{"unit_id":"life1996cou__dsh-timer#feature-4","repo":"life1996cou/dsh-timer","commit":"2c9cbf0397c7fd0a9bfd282c80361f28d3bc4d92","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@deepseek-ai/dsh-timer 的功能「取消与清空」：在任务列表中可取消待执行或运行中的单项任务，也可清空任务列表；宿主会撤销对应的定时器并移除任务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:430-436","lib/client.js:459-465","lib/index.js:4232-4245"]}
{"unit_id":"life1996cou__dsh-timer#caveat-1","repo":"life1996cou/dsh-timer","commit":"2c9cbf0397c7fd0a9bfd282c80361f28d3bc4d92","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@deepseek-ai/dsh-timer 使用前须知：任务绑定创建时的会话；触发时若该会话已不在运行中，任务会失败。任务保存在宿主内存中，服务清理时会全部撤销。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:4161-4165","lib/index.js:4210-4223","lib/index.js:4247-4249"]}
